   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Both of these describe what happens when you multiply two ints. Grep finds the long one\nfirst, because it is longer and because there are three of them. Reading it teaches you\nwhat the code generator does, which is not what you asked.",
